{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e05-scene-12",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "让他俩都满意  (Satisfying Both Bosses at Once)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Back at Xingtian, Xingzi reminds Bu Xiaogu that Chun Yuqiao hates threats and would never use show slots to shield himself from gossip. Listen to Xingzi and Xiaogu work out a plan in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你答应了许天泽，让他们上文娱论？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "而且还要拿出一个让他们满意的电视节目方案？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "文娱论我们只是监制，提案是二部的事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "就算让你提案，你有把握打动老大让他过关吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我只知道如果不让他们上节目的话，他们就去对手那边了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "如果让老大知道，他只会故意不理，任由他们胡说八道。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总说过，他是幕后制作人，不怕被非议。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "可是他最讨厌被威胁，绝对不会拿节目资源为自己挡枪。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "要不这样，我先瞒着淳于总，拿出一个让许天泽满意的方案。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "还得瞒住许天泽，拿出一个让老大同意的方案。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那意思就是说，我得拿出一个方案，让他俩都满意！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你答应了许天泽，让他们上文娱论？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You promised Xu Tianze to put them on Entertainment Talk?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "而且还要拿出一个让他们满意的电视节目方案？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And you even have to produce a television proposal that satisfies them?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "文娱论我们只是监制，提案是二部的事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'On Entertainment Talk we only supervise; pitching topics belongs to Unit Two.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "就算让你提案，你有把握打动老大让他过关吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Even if you are allowed to pitch, are you confident you can win our boss's approval?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我只知道如果不让他们上节目的话，他们就去对手那边了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All I know is that if we do not bring them onto our show, they will go to our rival.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "如果让老大知道，他只会故意不理，任由他们胡说八道。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If our boss finds out, he will deliberately ignore it and let them talk nonsense.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总说过，他是幕后制作人，不怕被非议。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Chun Yuqiao said he is a behind-the-scenes producer and does not fear gossip.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "可是他最讨厌被威胁，绝对不会拿节目资源为自己挡枪。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet he hates threats most of all and would never use show resources as a shield for himself.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "要不这样，我先瞒着淳于总，拿出一个让许天泽满意的方案。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How about this: keeping Mr Chun Yuqiao in the dark first, I draft a plan that satisfies Xu Tianze.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "还得瞒住许天泽，拿出一个让老大同意的方案。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And keeping Xu Tianze in the dark, you also need a plan our boss will approve.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那意思就是说，我得拿出一个方案，让他俩都满意！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That means I have to come up with one proposal that satisfies both of them!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你答应了许天泽，让他们上文娱论？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "而且还要拿出一个让他们满意的电视节目方案？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "文娱论我们只是监制，提案是二部的事。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "就算让你提案，你有把握打动老大让他过关吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我只知道如果不让他们上节目的话，他们就去对手那边了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "如果让老大知道，他只会故意不理，任由他们胡说八道。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总说过，他是幕后制作人，不怕被非议。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "可是他最讨厌被威胁，绝对不会拿节目资源为自己挡枪。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "要不这样，我先瞒着淳于总，拿出一个让许天泽满意的方案。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "还得瞒住许天泽，拿出一个让老大同意的方案。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那意思就是说，我得拿出一个方案，让他俩都满意！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "To pull off the impossible, Xiaogu resolves to write one talk-show proposal strong enough to win over both sides on merit alone. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "明天见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
